<title>BULGARIA: NO CORPORATE STOCKS TRADE ON BULGARIA EXCHANGES.</title>
<headline>NO CORPORATE STOCKS TRADE ON BULGARIA EXCHANGES.</headline>
<dateline>SOFIA 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The RABSI (Reuter All Bulgaria Stock Index) was unchanged from Friday's 41.02 points as no corporate stocks traded on Bulgarian bourses, brokers said.</p>
<p>No repo deals were struck on Bulgarian exchanges either.</p>
<p>Friday's repo turnover hit an all-time high of 23.619 million levs.</p>
<p>-- Dessislava Popova, Sofia Newsroom, 359-2-84561</p>
